DESCRIPTION:Building Enclosure Council of Houston Presents: \nOptimizing th
	e Building Enclosure Envelope \nGenerative Design Strategies for Early-Sta
	ge Architectural Performance \nPresenter: Joe Fong\, RA\, LEED AP \nDiscov
	er how Autodesk Forma and Generative Design are transforming the architect
	ural workflow from early concept to team collaboration. In this session\, 
	you’ll learn how to rapidly generate performance-based building massings t
	ailored to site constraints\, perform comprehensive site analyses early in
	 the design phase\, and streamline team coordination. Step into a unified\
	, shared workspace where design options can be evaluated\, compared\, and 
	refined in real time. \nAIA CE Credit: Pending Approval \nSchedule: \n\n4:
	30pm – Check-in\n5:00pm – Presentation\n\nAdditional Information: \n\nBeer
	 & Wine Available\nParking is not included\nA minimum of 3 business days’ 
	notice is required to receive a full refund if you need to cancel your res
	ervation.\n\n  \nTHANK YOU TO OUR UNDERWRITER SPONSOR! \n\nhttps://archite
